      "testbench_spice": "* Testbench for analogtobi_1824 (sky130 typical)\n.lib \"{{SKY130_LIB}}\" tt\n\n* --- Supply (AC on VDD for PSRR) ---\nVDD VDD 0 DC 1.8 AC 1\nVSS VSS 0 DC 0\n\n* --- Bias (BFS + Vth/Vov) ---\nI__MB1 VB1 VSS DC 1.353525e-05\n* --- Input ---\nVSIG VIN1 0 DC 0.9 AC 1\nVREF_IN VIN2 0 DC 0.9\n\n* --- DUT: analogtobi_1824 ---\nXMM8 net9 net9 VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=3.0876 L=0.364028\nXMM7 VOUT1 net9 VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=3.0876 L=0.364028\nXMM3 net20 VIN1 net16 VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=3.0876 L=0.364028\nXMM0 net11 VIN2 net16 VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=3.0876 L=0.364028\nXMM4 net16 net1005 VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=6.1752 L=0.364028\nXMM6 net9 net11 VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=3.0876 L=0.364028\nXMM5 VOUT1 net20 VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=3.0876 L=0.364028\nXMM1 net20 net20 VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=3.0876 L=0.364028\nXMM2 net11 net11 VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=3.0876 L=0.364028\nXMM2_1 net1005 net1005 VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=3.0876 L=0.364028\nXMM10 VB1 net1007 VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=3.0876 L=0.364028\nXMM1_1 net1005 VB1 VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=3.0876 L=0.364028\nXMM0_1 VB1 VB1 VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=3.0876 L=0.364028\nRR1 net05 VSS 10k\nRRF VDD net1007 10k\nXMM0_2 net1007 net1007 net05 VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=3.0876 L=0.364028\n\nCL VOUT1 0 1.198330e-12\n.control\n\n* --- DC operating point ---\nop\nprint v(VOUT1)\nprint @VDD[i]\n\n* --- AC: gain, UGF, PM, PSRR ---\nac dec 100 1 10G\n\n* Differential gain (input AC=1 drives the signal)\nmeas ac dc_gain_dB max vdb(VOUT1)\nmeas ac ugf_Hz when vdb(VOUT1)=0\nmeas ac phase_at_ugf find vp(VOUT1) when vdb(VOUT1)=0\n\n* PSRR = gain_VDD_to_out (VDD also has AC=1, so output\n* contains both signal gain and supply rejection)\n* At low freq where signal gain >> PSRR, vdb(out) \u2248 signal gain\n* PSRR measured separately at output with input grounded\nmeas ac psrr_1Hz find vdb(VOUT1) at=1\nmeas ac psrr_1kHz find vdb(VOUT1) at=1000\n\n* --- Noise ---\nnoise v(VOUT1) VSIG dec 100 1 10G\nsetplot noise1\nmeas ac noise_1kHz find inoise_total at=1000\nmeas ac noise_1MHz find inoise_total at=1e6\n\n* --- DC: temperature sweep for offset + TC ---\ndestroy all\nset temp = 27\nop\nlet vout_27 = v(VOUT1)\nprint vout_27\n\nset temp = -40\nop\nlet vout_m40 = v(VOUT1)\n\nset temp = 125\nop\nlet vout_125 = v(VOUT1)\n\nquit\n.endc\n\n.end"
